1S0G","text":"ただ、プラグインとしてのスコープを広げるか、については勇気が要りますね。関数呼び出しを対象とするには余裕のある仕様にしていますが、それでいろいろできるからといって「いろいろ」をサポートするかについては「いろいろ」の内容によると思います。","ts":"1629429871.092500","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rkxsS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81928d54-8132-4af7-b545-90cce926a7de","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"確かにむずいですね・・・","ts":"1629430817.092700","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZrCv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00d955a5-1b3b-4563-b87f-6b1dcf0e7bbe","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今はGenericsの追加と、ついさっき `${}` を追加したんですよね","ts":"1629430849.092900","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bn+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bb7136d-2808-40ab-9634-2e59e88201ca","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```  \\ {\n  \\   'header' : '\\$',\n  \\   'bra'    : '{',\n  \\   'ket'    : '}',\n  \\   'footer' : '',\n  \\ },```","ts":"1629430858.093100","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Caz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed0828a5-be8a-4b76-9594-5d6546bfc8b0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これで `if` `af` で `${foo}` が選択できるようになったので、expand-regionで選択できるようになりました","ts":"1629430910.093300","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uJ6SJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f46b4b2d-9860-42e2-a8a5-7efb6d0c3b9e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分ここに動的に `i$` `a$` での選択を追加できるとかの実装が理想なんだとは思うんですが、思想が大きく変わる気がしています","ts":"1629430961.093500","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hlH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4347cf3d-f2b5-4a59-bdb9-f66b1eb251b7","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"`if` `af` とは別に `i$` `a$` で `${foo}` を選択したいということですかね。独立したキーマッピングを作りたいということであればできると思います。","ts":"1629454604.108000","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uJ+Iw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37e49f1b-81c8-43b1-a5a8-b23cd84a9cb1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"です！","ts":"1629454621.108200","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f9ZD0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"883b4cc3-5113-480b-9fcc-a31f8ce52539","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今はgenericsもif, afで選択になっているので","ts":"1629454649.108400","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aLMO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5bbe0bdf-8d50-48db-baea-3872a5a68da8","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"あ、すいません嘘でした。まだ出来ない。\nでもできるようにします。","ts":"1629454653.108600","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","edited":{"user":"U9GUS1S0G","ts":"1629454670.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1ZJ/H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9b13b77-ae4b-4a5c-8319-e7360800b094","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"出来ました。こんな感じで使います。\n\n```let g:patternlist = [\n\t\\   {\n\t\\     'header': '\\$'\n\t\\     'bra': '{'\n\t\\     'ket': '}'\n\t\\     'footer': ''\n\t\\   }\n\t\\ ]\n\nonoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; i$ :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;call textobj#functioncall#i('o', g:patternlist)\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\nxnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; i$ :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;call textobj#functioncall#i('x', g:patternlist)\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\nonoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; a$ :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;call textobj#functioncall#a('o', g:patternlist)\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\nxnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; a$ :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;call textobj#functioncall#a('x', g:patternlist)\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;```","ts":"1629458694.109000","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","edited":{"user":"U9GUS1S0G","ts":"1629458823.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fmW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f90a890-b725-4d39-85bf-f23a50cd1922","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"インターフェースは原始的ですがあまり複雑なコードを抱えたくないので…ユーザーに自分でマッピングを書いてもらう方針です。","ts":"1629458763.109200","thread_ts":"1629425584.092100","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rqEP3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"918aa31d-1e31-4c18-8192-e8d85838dab5","type":"message","user":"U0M7GCBPD","text":"了解です〜\n\nft=vim で辞書リテラルの中でコメントアウトすると `\" \\\" じゃなく `\"\\` (スペースを入れない) ようにする実装と同じ感じでやればよさそう :tabunikeru:","ts":"1629386703.089500","thread_ts":"1629386264.089200","edited":{"user":"U0M7GCBPD","ts":"1629386715.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QPM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15b70193-3d5f-4ae1-95b9-8b3f2af68f77","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"期待","ts":"1629387572.089900","thread_ts":"1629386264.089200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sr5r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5249e26-b219-4756-8ffa-481a0e405ac5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"個人的には、ファイルの先頭に `vim9script` と書かれていたら、での分岐で十分です。ちゃんとやるなら `vim9script` をもう少しちゃんと探すのと、 `def` ～ `enddef` の間が Vim9 script になるのと、実は最近だと以下の部分も Vim9 script になります\n```command Foo {\n  # ここに Vim9 script が書ける\n}\n\nautocmd BufEnter * {\n  # ここにも書ける\n  # イベント名はどれでもOK\n}```","ts":"1629388001.090100","thread_ts":"1629386264.089200","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gVSe"}]}]
